# Privacy Policy – SONORA Offline Music Player

**Developer:** Farhan Sadik  
**App Name:** SONORA – Offline Music Player

## 1. Introduction
SONORA – Offline Music Player respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how the app accesses and handles information when you use it.

## 2. Information We Collect
SONORA does not collect, store, or share personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, or location.

## 3. Access to Your Music Files
The app may request permission to access audio files stored on your device. This permission is used only to:
- Find and display your local music files.
- Play audio stored on your device.
- Organize songs, albums, artists, and playlists.
- Display available music metadata and album artwork.

Your music files remain on your device. SONORA does not upload or transfer them to our servers.

## 4. Data Sharing
SONORA does not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.

## 5. Internet Connection
The app is designed primarily for offline music playback. It does not require an internet connection for its core music-playing features.

## 6. Data Security
Since SONORA does not collect or store personal information on external servers, your personal data remains under your control. Please keep your device secure.

## 7. Children's Privacy
SONORA does not knowingly collect personal information from children or other users.

## 8. Changes to This Policy
This Privacy Policy may be updated when app features or privacy practices change. Any updated version will be made available with the app.

